        "prose": "Yukon paused the game at exactly the wrong moment and spent a full minute explaining why this was tactical. The frozen character hung over a digital cliff. “See? Control.” His thumb slipped. The pause vanished. So did the character. Yukon stared at the screen. “Sabotage.”"
