        "prose": "A station flashed past without stopping, all white tile and startled faces. The Streamliner’s runes brightened once beneath the floor. Ashai felt the change through her boots. Goaden lifted his head at the same instant. “Still weird?” he asked. “Still incredible.” He accepted that with a small nod."
