        "prose": "The train entered a tower and daylight vanished. For two breaths the carriage existed inside concrete, offices ghosting beyond the windows as pale afterimages. Then London opened again. Greah spun once in the returning light. Kai yawned. The humans reacted somewhere between those extremes."
