        "prose": "The earlier briefing had left a phrase between them that neither had liked. It returned at lunch without being spoken. Ashai broke a piece of bread into smaller and smaller sections. Goaden eventually pushed the salt towards her though she had not asked for it. The gesture was useless. It helped."
