        "trigger_family": "TRAVEL_DEPART|TRAVEL_ARRIVE",
        "effect_policy": "surface_only",
        "prose": "The Streamliner slipped through a tower and the carriage filled for one breath with ghostly office light. Ashai looked up every time the train passed through a building. Goaden pretended not to notice until the third. “Still impressed?” “Yes.” “Fair.” The city returned to ordinary solidity before the thought finished."
