        "trigger_family": "TRAVEL_DEPART|TRAVEL_ARRIVE",
        "effect_policy": "surface_only",
        "prose": "The expanded carriage offered more space than its exterior had any right to contain. Goaden lowered the music in one ear when the wards brightened. Kai watched the shimmer along the window. “Habit?” “Experience.” Once the light settled, the volume went back up. A tunnel swallowed the view and left only their reflections."
