        "prose": "The Dread Twins occupied opposite sides of a doorway in near-perfect symmetry. Truth glanced around the Armadillo's common room. “You live here now?” Goaden shrugged. “Temporarily.” Truth smiled. “That's how institutions get you.” Gabriel found a new complaint before the old one cooled."
