        "prose": "An unofficial debrief had become food, chairs and an envelope nobody called an invoice. Greah inspected Rose's moving tattoos at close range. Rose turned her wrist to give a better look. “They're showing off.” Greah nodded. “Understandable.” Ashai sighed at both of them. Truth's light faded and left only the ordinary room behind."
