        "trigger_family": "PRACTICE_END|ACTIVITY_COMPLETE",
        "effect_policy": "surface_only",
        "prose": "Cooling fans whispered overhead while combat telemetry collapsed into neat graphs along one wall. Rose’s moving tattoos settled as she stepped off the mat. “Enough.” Goaden raised an eyebrow. “You telling me?” “I’m telling me. You can make your own bad choices.” The ward lights dimmed and took the decision away from them."
