        "prose": "Projection lights faded from the AR room, leaving ordinary walls where a battlefield had been seconds earlier. They watched rain sheet across the closed outdoor ground. Goaden folded his arms. “Could still train.” Ashai pointed to the lightning warning rune. “You can. I’ll watch from somewhere dry.” The ward lights dimmed and took the decision away from them."
