        "trigger_family": "QUIET_TIME_BEGIN|ACTIVITY_COMPLETE",
        "effect_policy": "surface_only",
        "prose": "Past midnight, the Armadillo quieted enough for a piano note to travel farther than conversation. Ashai paused in the doorway rather than interrupt. Goaden noticed her reflection in the piano lid. “Couldn’t sleep?” “Could ask you the same.” He moved one hand off the keys. “You could.” The building carried on around them, distant and muffled."
