        "effect_policy": "surface_only",
        "prose": "The lift gave them half a minute of enforced company. Davis watched Ashai finish a clean drill. “Better.” Ashai lifted an eyebrow. “Was that praise?” “Don't make me regret it.” Both smiled, though Davis's lasted a fraction longer. Ashai filed the advice away with the other things she was still learning about MI6."
