        "prose": "Nimbus's cloud-fur shifted from pale silver to storm-grey and back again. Goaden felt his pocket move. Kai leaned down. Two bright eyes appeared between folds of fabric. “Nah.” Nimbus sank deeper into the jacket and purred harder. Kai looked as though he was considering doing so personally."
