        "prose": "A trail of cool vapour marked the route Nimbus had taken through the room. A harmless practice mote drifted too close. Nimbus opened its mouth. “Don't.” The mote vanished. Nimbus hiccupped blue light. Ashai closed her eyes. Goaden checked his remaining pockets."
