        "effect_policy": "surface_only",
        "prose": "The common room had gone quiet enough for Guardian-sized arguments to become audible. Greah caught her halo reflected in Kai's polished scale and turned her head to inspect it. “That angle is better.” Kai sighed. “I am not a mirror.” “Today you are.” The argument ended only because something more interesting moved."
