        "effect_policy": "surface_only",
        "prose": "The building hummed around them while both Guardians listened to something humans could not hear. A ward rune flickered. Kai leaned closer. Greah leaned closer to Kai. “Broken?” “Recalibrating.” “You know that because?” “It says so.” Greah looked at the tiny text. “Show-off.” Kai closed his eyes, which Greah counted as surrender."
