        "prose": "The Sanctuary floated above London on cloud foundations, firefly lights looping its gothic spires and metal ribs. Ashai turned slowly beneath the portal archways, trying to look everywhere at once. Yukon laughed. “Told you.” Greah spun in the air, halo bright with reflected colour. “This place has no restraint. I approve.” Another portal opened and gave them a completely new reason to stay."
