        "prose": "Cloud vapour curled along the outer terrace while the city glittered impossibly far below. Yukon pointed at three portals in quick succession. “That one sounds dangerous, that one smells expensive, and that one has drums.” Ashai folded her arms. “Which means?” “Drums.” Cloud drifted across the balcony and briefly hid the city."
