        "effect_policy": "surface_only",
        "prose": "Rain had left small mirrors between the plaza stones, and Emily stepped around some but through others. Emily pushed the swing once, twice, then stopped at the exact same height on the third arc. She looked down at the shadow beneath the seat as if checking its work. The moment ended when Emily decided it had."
