        "effect_policy": "surface_only",
        "prose": "The evening bell from New Big Ben rolled over the plaza and Emily started counting again. Whisper looked at Emily. Emily looked at Whisper. “You're strange,” she said. His visible eye narrowed with amusement. “Cheers.” Yukon, unusually, accepted the silence."
