        "prose": "Her school uniform made her look misplaced among MI6 glass, steel and armed adults. Yukon found Emily on the swing he had been heading for. “Mind if I take the other one?” “Yes.” He sat on it anyway. Emily looked at him. “Expected.” A bell sounded and Emily began counting from one."
