        "effect_policy": "surface_only",
        "prose": "A low thunder-purr rolled from somewhere it had no business coming from. Davis reached for her badge and found the clip empty. Nimbus sat beneath a chair with the rectangle between its paws. “Give me that.” The cloud rat became mist. Davis's smile lost one degree of warmth. The object was eventually recovered, though dignity was not."
