        "effect_policy": "surface_only",
        "prose": "Something shiny moved across the floor under its own apparent power. Yukon placed one crumb on the floor. Then another. Nimbus followed both. “Training,” Yukon whispered. Goaden passed behind him. “Bribery.” “Successful training.” Nimbus found somewhere warm and immediately forgot the dispute."
