        "effect_policy": "surface_only",
        "prose": "Nimbus sat with both front paws together, presenting innocence as a formal argument. Nimbus tried to climb onto Kai's back. Kai moved. Nimbus followed. “No.” Nimbus sat down and thunder-purred. “That is not persuasion.” Nobody had written cloud-rat procedure into MI6 policy yet."
