        "prose": "Static crawled briefly through Nimbus's leafy tufts and vanished. Greah found three clips, a coin and a spoon beneath the sofa. Nimbus appeared behind her. “Evidence,” Greah said. Nimbus picked up the spoon and vanished into fog. A final spark popped in the air and the room pretended it had not."
