        "prose": "Three people reached for the remote. Ashai got there first. Yukon protested. Goaden looked personally betrayed. “I was here first,” Ashai said. “That is not how democracy works,” Yukon replied. Goaden settled deeper into the sofa. “Pretty sure this isn’t democracy.”"
