        "trigger_family": "",
        "effect_policy": "surface_only",
        "prose": "Greah settled against the warm side of Ashai’s mug with a tiny sigh. “That is my tea.” “And this is my heating.” Ashai lifted the mug. Greah rose with it, refusing to surrender contact. “Parasite.” “Guardian.”"
