        "trigger_family": "",
        "effect_policy": "surface_only",
        "prose": "Yukon was already on the mat when Goaden entered. “Booked it,” Yukon said immediately. Goaden looked at the empty room. “Whole thing?” “Emotionally, yes.” Goaden dropped his bag by the wall. “Move your emotions left.”"
