        "trigger_family": "",
        "effect_policy": "surface_only",
        "prose": "A crumb vanished from Ashai’s plate. She looked down. Nimbus was under the table, cloud-fur rolling softly around its shoulders. “Really?” Its eyes widened with complete innocence. A second crumb disappeared. Greah, somewhere above, made a noise of deep personal vindication."
