        "trigger_family": "",
        "effect_policy": "surface_only",
        "prose": "Emily’s shadow looked too dark under the corridor lights. Goaden noticed and kept walking. She noticed him noticing. “Something wrong?” she asked. “Not yet.” Emily’s mouth moved slightly. It might have been amusement."
