        "trigger_family": "",
        "effect_policy": "surface_only",
        "prose": "Nimbus approached Emily in a slow curl of mist. Emily lowered one hand. The cloud rat sniffed her fingers, then retreated exactly one step. “Smart,” she said. Nimbus sat down. Neither appeared interested in pleasing the other."
