        "trigger_family": "",
        "effect_policy": "surface_only",
        "prose": "Emily looked at each ceiling camera as she passed. Zara noticed by the fifth. “Problem?” “Seven.” “Seven what?” Emily pointed ahead. “Cameras.” Zara did not ask why she was counting."
