        "trigger_family": "",
        "effect_policy": "surface_only",
        "prose": "Ashai offered tea because doing nothing felt stranger. Emily looked at the cup. “Is it poisoned?” “No.” “Shame.” Ashai stared at her. Emily took the tea anyway."
