        "prose": "The scanner accepted Anarchy’s human hand and rejected the demonic one. Zara looked at the red light. Anarchy looked at his arm. Balthazar’s claws flexed. “Racial profiling,” Balthazar said. Zara pressed the manual override. “Hardware profiling.”"
