        "prose": "Gabriel was halfway through blaming the brief when Anarchy raised both hands. “Timeout.” Gabriel kept talking. “That is not a timeout.” Anarchy pointed to the bench. “Sit. Water. Then complain with structure.” Gabriel sat, still complaining."
