        "prose": "They reached for the same file. Davis’s fingers arrived first. “After you,” she said, without releasing it. Ashai looked at her hand. Davis’s smile widened. Ashai released the folder. “Enjoy.” Davis had won absolutely nothing and somehow behaved as if she had."
