        "prose": "Davis pressed Ashai’s floor before Ashai could. “Still learning the maze?” “I know where I’m going.” “Good.” The lift doors closed. Ashai looked at the illuminated number. “You pressed the wrong one.” Davis glanced at it. “Testing you.”"
